---
// 使用场景：六宫格卡片
---
<section class="section" id="scenes">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-head">
      <span class="eyebrow">SCENES · 使用场景</span>
      <h2>校园里的每一个「搭子」需求</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="scenes">
      <div class="scene">
        <span>📚</span>
        <div><b>二手教材 / 笔记流转</b><small>期末高频流转，定价学生友好</small></div>
      </div>
      <div class="scene">
        <span>🧋</span>
        <div><b>奶茶拼单 / 团购</b><small>凑满减、拼配送，5 人即成团</small></div>
      </div>
      <div class="scene">
        <span>🚗</span>
        <div><b>顺风车 / 代取</b><small>同校顺路，寒暑假返乡互助</small></div>
      </div>
      <div class="scene">
        <span>📷</span>
        <div><b>摄影约拍 / 技能交换</b><small>修图换剪辑，技能互补</small></div>
      </div>
      <div class="scene">
        <span>🎓</span>
        <div><b>考研 / 考公搭子</b><small>同目标互相监督，资料共享</small></div>
      </div>
      <div class="scene">
        <span>🏀</span>
        <div><b>运动 / 活动组局</b><small>缺一不可的球局，一键组齐</small></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .scenes { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); gap: 14px; }
  .scene { display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 12px; background: #fff; border: 2.5px solid var(--ink); border-radius: 16px; padding: 16px 18px; box-shadow: var(--shadow-hard); transition: transform .2s, box-shadow .2s; }
  .scene:hover { transform: translate(-2px, -3px) rotate(-1deg); box-shadow: var(--shadow-hard-lg); }
  .scene span { font-size: 26px; line-height: 1.3; }
  .scene b { display: block; font-size: 15.5px; line-height: 1.4; }
  .scene small { display: block; font-size: 12.5px; font-weight: 600; color: var(--ink-soft); line-height: 1.5; margin-top: 2px; }
  @media (max-width: 920px) { .scenes { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); } }
  @media (max-width: 560px) { .scenes { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } }
</style>
